WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.378
- Yo, Will.
- Yo.

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.879
My fault I ain't call
you back, man,

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:06.214
it's been a crazy ass day.

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:07.340
Your mom told me you got
sprung out of jail, 

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.341
but she won’t say
where you at.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.051
You’re still in Philly, right?

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:13.013
Nah, bro, I’m in L.A.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:13.847
L.A.?

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.390
Man, stop cappin’, yo.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.517
No cap!  Man, this shit
happened so quick!

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.144
Bro, Rashad’s gotta
bag on your head, bro. 

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.729
He’s saying you snitched
to get out.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.896
What?

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:22.939
No one snitched on nobody.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.816
Then how you get
out of jail then?

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.318
My uncle pulled
 some crazy lawyer shit.

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.486
That's all I know. 

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:30.822
Rashad wants you dead, bro.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.615
I think I'm next.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.285
You gotta come back and
clear this shit up, like, ASAP.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:38.872
Just be cool, aight?
Be cool, and lay low.  Aight?

00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:43.084
I’m scared.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:49.299
I’m coming.  I’mma fix this.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:52.677
Aight, bro.

00:01:26.961 --> 00:01:30.006
What the hell is this
Jackie Chan, Splinter Cell shit?

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.382
Shit!

00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:42.644
Yo Jazz, man, I've got to
get to LAX, man.

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:43.937
I gotta catch a midnight
flight to Philly.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:46.314
Wait, you didn't kill or rob
nobody in that mansion, did you?

00:01:46.314 --> 00:01:47.607
‘Cause I ain’t tryna
catch a case, Will.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.942
Nah man, everybody in the
mansion is good,

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.693
I just got to get back home
ASAP, aight?

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:51.694
Come on, let’s go!

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:54.656
But you're already home, Will.

00:01:55.031 --> 00:01:56.616
Shit.

00:01:58.201 --> 00:01:59.494
Turn it off.

00:02:04.207 --> 00:02:05.542
Well, who are you? 

00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:08.253
Phillip Banks,
Will's Uncle.

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:09.337
Who the hell are you?

00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:13.174
Uh... Jazz...
What up?

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.176
Jazz.

00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:25.186
Thank you for your time, Jazz. 

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.606
Thank you for your money, Phil. 

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:31.568
Let's go back inside, Will.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.788
I guess you missed
the 20 cameras

00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:45.999
surrounding the property.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.334
By the way,
what was the plan here?

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:52.046
So you go to LAX
and then what?  Hmm?

00:02:54.716 --> 00:02:56.509
Fly home and
fix my situation.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.303
Hmm.

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:01.472
What about that gangster
 you pulled a gun on? 

00:03:01.472 --> 00:03:04.934
I mean I find it hard to believe
he’d just let that go.

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.603
What was your plan there?

00:03:13.902 --> 00:03:16.112
Let me ask you something, Will.

00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:19.073
You care if you live or die? 

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.496
Yeah.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.125
Me too.

00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:34.881
So does your Mom, your Aunt,
 and everyone in this house.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.841
I can handle mine. 

00:03:36.841 --> 00:03:38.968
I ain’t never had no Daddy.

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:40.929
I’ve been my own man.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.431
A real man takes the
time to consider 

00:03:43.431 --> 00:03:46.267
the consequences
of his actions.

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:49.020
A real man knows
 when to let go of his pride

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.189
and make the most out
 of his second chance. 

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:54.525
A real man also knows
 how to look another man 

00:03:54.525 --> 00:03:56.986
in the eye when saying
 something.  Look at me. 

00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:05.245
I believe in you, Will.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:08.289
Be patient.

00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:11.918
Give this a real chance,
 and I promise...

00:04:12.794 --> 00:04:14.087
that you’ll have
every opportunity

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.964
to create the future you want.

00:04:20.551 --> 00:04:22.887
You have my word. 

00:04:30.144 --> 00:04:32.480
Do we have a deal?

00:04:38.528 --> 00:04:40.822
Good.

